<title>USA: ICO acquires Bayshore Industrial.</title>
<headline>ICO acquires Bayshore Industrial.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>ICO Inc said on Wednesday it aquired Bayshore Industrial Inc, a Texas-based provider of concentrates and compounds to the petrochemicals industry.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Bayshore has annual revenues of about $30 million and has been consistently profitable, ICO said. It would become a wholly owned ICO subsidiary.</p>
<p>ICO said Bayshore's strong market position in concentrates and compounds was an excellent complement to services offered by its Wedco Technology Inc unit.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
